# Adapted for this repo: the upstream .gitignore excludes site/profile.md, on the
# assumption this folder is a clone of the shared course template where a student's
# personal facts shouldn't get committed back upstream. This repo IS the personal
# deliverable, so profile.md, design.md, and content.md are meant to be committed —
# they're the actual work product, not local scratch state.

# Camera output. Regenerated by check.py and render.sh every run.
site/*.png

# Any CV/résumé dropped in here for reference. Never commit this.
*.pdf

# The loop's notes to itself.
progress.md
